{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/binghatti-onyx-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":693,"crm_id":"95","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Binghatti Onyx","slug":"binghatti-onyx-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["commerce"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Binghatti","price":4291033,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.061699,"longitude":55.1962184,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Onyx - a project by the developer Binghatti at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/jumeirah-village-circle/\">JVC</a>, which has a unique modern design in white-orange colors combined with wooden facades.</p><p>Among the amenities on the area of the complex residents can enjoy a swimming pool with sun loungers, a gym with the most modern equipment, children's playgrounds and sports grounds, including a basketball court, and also a green picturesque park with walking paths and places for recreation. Within walking distance are stores, restaurants, cafes and parks.</p><p>The complex is conveniently situated near the main thoroughfares of Dubai, which provides residents with quick access to the public and social infrastructure of the city. Circle Mall is just three minutes away, Dubai Marina and JBR beach are 15 minutes away by car, and the road to Business Bay, Downtown and Burj Khalifa will take 20 minutes.</p><p>Onyx offers premium apartments with a contemporary design that provides a high level of comfort and coziness for residents. Investing in this project is guaranteed to profit a high stable income.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/9